WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.305
Welcome back, little explorer!

2
00:00:02.305 --> 00:00:03.736
Daisy Deer here.

3
00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:07.125
Today we learn about letters and their sounds!

4
00:00:08.226 --> 00:00:09.384
Are you ready?

5
00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:11.078
Let's find out together!

6
00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:13.216
Look!

7
00:00:13.216 --> 00:00:14.605
This is A.

8
00:00:14.605 --> 00:00:15.953
A says "ah".

9
00:00:15.953 --> 00:00:17.591
A is for Apple!

10
00:00:19.106 --> 00:00:20.943
Which one is A?

11
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.418
Remember: A says "ah".

12
00:00:27.418 --> 00:00:29.002
A is for Apple!

13
00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:31.148
Look!

14
00:00:31.148 --> 00:00:34.037
This is B. B says "buh".

15
00:00:34.037 --> 00:00:35.426
B is for Bear!

16
00:00:36.942 --> 00:00:38.517
Can you say B with me?

17
00:00:38.517 --> 00:00:39.626
Let's try!

18
00:00:43.826 --> 00:00:44.678
Look!

19
00:00:44.678 --> 00:00:47.595
This is C. C says "kuh".

20
00:00:47.595 --> 00:00:49.053
C is for Cat!

21
00:00:50.554 --> 00:00:51.933
Which one is C?

22
00:00:56.142 --> 00:00:58.368
Remember: C says "kuh".

23
00:00:58.368 --> 00:00:59.897
C is for Cat!

24
00:01:01.206 --> 00:01:02.086
Wow!

25
00:01:02.086 --> 00:01:04.169
You learned so much today.

26
00:01:04.169 --> 00:01:06.267
I am so proud of you!

27
00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:09.749
Great job, my friend!

28
00:01:09.749 --> 00:01:12.249
Come back soon and we'll learn more.

29
00:01:12.249 --> 00:01:13.332
Bye bye!

30
00:01:14.342 --> 00:01:17.430
Try "Colors All Around Us" next!
